        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-OMP1017RDDSBR, Decorative Reed and Tassel Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis highly detailed Reed and Tassel Appliance Pull from First Impressions is 17 inches long with a 7 inch center to center. It comes packaged with everything you need to install it on nearly any appliance in your home from the refrigerator to the freezer and even the oven. The OMP1017RDDSBR Handle was designed and made by craftsmen right here in the U.S.A. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. We believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/decorative-reed-and-tassel-handle-pull-first-impressions-omp1017rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions OMP1017RDDSBR Tassel Entry Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-OMP1017RDDSBR Decorative Reed and Tassel Refrigerator Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n<li>These Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-826-detail.jpg?v=1704354556\" target=\"new\"><b>First Impressions AP-OMP1017RDDSBR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-OLY01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262218\"><b>First Impressions AP-OMP1017RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths and Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
